</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"1\" data-flow-node=\"model\" transform=\"translate(440 30)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"65\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#e4f0e7\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">非线性响应面</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">拟合平方项与交互项</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"1\" data-flow-node=\"baseline\" transform=\"translate(440 140)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"55\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#f4efe4\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">线性经验基线</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">同样实验条件比较</text></g>\n <g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-node=\"gate\" data-flow-step=\"2\"><polygon points=\"735,20 800,65 735,110 670,65\" fill=\"#fbf0d9\"/><text x=\"735\" y=\"71\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">输入与场景是否对应？差异需要人工复核吗？</text></g>\n <g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"2\" data-flow-node=\"review\" transform=\"translate(670 140)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"55\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#f6eade\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">筛选可行配方</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">温度和PV上下限</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"2\" data-flow-node=\"output\" transform=\"translate(880 30)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"65\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#e4f0e7\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">配方候选排序</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">目标偏差和相对成本</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"2\" data-flow-node=\"compare\" transform=\"translate(880 140)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"55\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#eff3f5\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">批次误差比较</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">留出PV的RMSE</text></g>\n </svg></div><figcaption>详细原理、数据图表与计算见下方各步骤。<span data-flow-instruction></span></figcaption></figure><article class=\"workflow-step flow-step\" data-step=\"0\"><h3>1. 分开实验批次</h3><p>140批拟合，70批独立评价。</p><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 95\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"分开实验批次的输入动作与产物\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"16\" width=\"250\" height=\"55\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#e7efea\"/><path d=\"M270 43H340l-10-7m10 7l-10 7\" stroke=\"#14796f\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"352\" y=\"16\" width=\"398\" height=\"55\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#f7f1e6\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"51\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#243740\">分开实验批次</text><text x=\"369\" y=\"51\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#243740\">批次RMSE</text></svg><p><b>产物：</b>批次RMSE</p><p class=\"sub\">注意：噪声只改变留出批次。</p></article><article class=\"workflow-step flow-step\" data-step=\"1\"><h3>2. 建立流变响应面</h3><p>拟合固相、剂量、温度及平方/交互项。</p><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 95\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"建立流变响应面的输入动作与产物\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"16\" width=\"250\" height=\"55\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#e7efea\"/><path d=\"M270 43H340l-10-7m10 7l-10 7\" stroke=\"#14796f\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"352\" y=\"16\" width=\"398\" height=\"55\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#f7f1e6\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"51\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#243740\">建立流变响应面</text><text x=\"369\" y=\"51\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#243740\">多项式系数与经验基线</text></svg><p><b>产物：</b>多项式系数与经验基线</p><p class=\"sub\">注意：响应面只覆盖本例参数范围。</p></article><article class=\"workflow-step flow-step\" data-step=\"2\"><h3>3. 搜索可行配方</h3><p>扫描剂量和固相网格，筛选PV范围再排序。</p><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 95\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"搜索可行配方的输入动作与产物\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"16\" width=\"250\" height=\"55\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#e7efea\"/><path d=\"M270 43H340l-10-7m10 7l-10 7\" stroke=\"#14796f\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"352\" y=\"16\" width=\"398\" height=\"55\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#f7f1e6\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"51\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#243740\">搜索可行配方</text><text x=\"369\" y=\"51\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#243740\">可行数量与候选剂量</text></svg><p><b>产物：</b>可行数量与候选剂量</p><p class=\"sub\">注意：没有可行点时说明约束冲突。</p></article>"
